number: XX
name: The Lamp
path: M3.5 2.022v7.956m5-7.956v7.956M11 1A9.995 9.995 0 0 1 1 1m10 10a10.001 10.001 0 0 0-10 0
uprightMeaning: solitude, vigil, inward turn
reversedMeaning: isolation, withdrawn light, severance
tags: season:winter, element:fire, gem:amethyst, flower:orchid
flavor: A small flame, carried at arm's length, by one who does not need it.

--- upright
He stands apart from the company. The lamp he carries was lit there. Those still on the path will see it before they see him.
---

--- reversed
The lamp is shielded against weather that has already passed. The hand that holds it has forgotten the path it was meant for.
---
